# the sleep timer (SEQ: OFF, 15 m, 30 m, 1 h, 2 h, 4 h, 8 h, round; from now): the picture dims over its last ten
# minutes, then the sound and the picture fade out over half a minute and all is dark and quiet; a button wakes it
# (only wakes) and the timer is off. SEL: the knobs' page before (with the bar hidden: the first, Scene, as FX)
wait 800
expect ledSEQ 1
expect ledSEL 1
expect ledEDIT 0
tap SEL
expect page 0
tap SEL
expect page 4
tap FX
expect page 0
wait 4000
tap SEQ
expect sleep 1
expect ledSEQ 2
tap SEQ
tap SEQ
tap SEQ
tap SEQ
tap SEQ
expect sleep 6
tap SEQ
expect sleep 0
expect ledSEQ 1
# 15 m: full until its last ten minutes, then dimming
tap SEQ
wait 240000
expect sleepdim 256
expect sleeplevel 100
wait 360000
expect sleepdim <190
expect sleeplevel 100
wait 290000
expect sleepdim <110
expect asleep 0
# the fade: half a minute
wait 35000
expect sleeplevel <10
wait 10000
expect asleep 2
expect sleep 0
expect sleepdim 0
expect sleeplevel 0
expect stale 0
expect race 0
# a press only wakes: GLO does not switch the style
expect style 0
tap GLO
wait 200
expect asleep 0
expect sleepdim 256
expect sleeplevel 100
expect style 0
tap GLO
expect style 1
tap GLO
wait 2000
expect stale 0
expect race 0
